      <div type="clause" n="2.3a">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIAtr">VII Atr</ref> 2.3a</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Hii sunt illi tres dies—dies Lunae, dies Martis et dies Mercurii proximi ante festum sancti Michaelis.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">These are the three days—the Monday, Tuesday and Wednesday immediately preceding the feast of St Michael.</ab>
